sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Middleware as Web Middleware
  participant App as Next.js App/Web
  participant Client as Browser

  Client->>Middleware: Request
  Middleware->>App: Forward with CSP nonce
  Middleware-->>Client: Security headers (CSP, HSTS, XFO, XCTO, RP, PP)
  App-->>Client: HTML with nonce applied
  Note right of Client: Browser enforces CSP and blocks inline scripts without nonce
